{"title":"Music Wizard of Oz","artist":"OSTER Project","sourceId":"reference:EmMrF4TSBnJKFt7tFbHl","sourceHash":"2bf8f01b14686ac6bfc900c0afe2d1aa1243db86980db591b2821ee070ed00b1","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":20.68,"end":23.68,"text":"「Prelude」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":27.22,"end":30.22,"text":"果てしなく広がるこの空の下","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":34.15,"end":37.15,"text":"僕らを導くのはあのメロディー","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":40.96,"end":43.96,"text":"遥かなる時間を越えて繋がる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":48.01,"end":51.01,"text":"どんなときも心は覚えているから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":56.55,"end":59.55,"text":"「One Ordinary Day」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":61.55,"end":64.23,"text":"いつものように目が覚めると","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":64.23,"end":67.23,"text":"いつものように鶏にエサをあげるの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":67.38,"end":70.24,"text":"いつものように焦げたトーストと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":70.24,"end":72.09,"text":"いつものように叔母さんガミガミ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":72.09,"end":72.92,"text":"叔父さんブツブツ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":72.92,"end":75.92,"text":"もうたくさんよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":76.25,"end":79.25,"text":"ああ私だっていつか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":81.68,"end":84.68,"text":"絵本みたいな冒険がしてみたいの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":87.95,"end":90.95,"text":"悪い魔女とか魔法使いとか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":94.03,"end":97.03,"text":"考えるだけでゾクゾクしちゃう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":100.03,"end":103.03,"text":"ああこのままどこかへ飛んで行きたいわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":107.78,"end":110.78,"text":"竜巻とかで...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":121.35,"end":124.35,"text":"（！？...キャー！！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":125.85,"end":128.85,"text":"「The Witch of the East is Dead!!」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":131.27,"end":134.27,"text":"気付けばそこは小人の国","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":142.13,"end":145.13,"text":"何やらおしゃべりが聞こえるよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":150.01,"end":152.91,"text":"信じられない！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":152.91,"end":155.24,"text":"今日はお祭りだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":155.24,"end":158.24,"text":"東の魔女が死んだ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":167.06,"end":170.06,"text":"意地悪で怖い魔女","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":170.32,"end":173.32,"text":"誰も逆らえやしない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":173.82,"end":176.63,"text":"隣の国の勇者様も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":176.63,"end":179.63,"text":"カエルに変えられ食べられた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":180.31,"end":183.31,"text":"だけど突然 飛んできた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":183.87,"end":186.87,"text":"家に潰され ぺしゃんこ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":187.52,"end":190.52,"text":"これじゃ魔法も使えやしないさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":190.93,"end":193.93,"text":"東の魔女が死んだ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":193.93,"end":196.93,"text":"竜巻に乗って飛んできただけよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":201.28,"end":204.25,"text":"風の魔法使いに祝福を！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":204.25,"end":206.49,"text":"一体ここはどこなの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":206.49,"end":209.49,"text":"我らの救世主に 願いを叶える旅を プレゼント","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":215.84,"end":218.84,"text":"あの道を辿って エメラルドの街へ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":223.39,"end":226.39,"text":"さあMusic Wizardの元へ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":231.17000000000002,"end":234.17000000000002,"text":"何やら迷い込んだ世界で始まる冒険","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":238.68,"end":241.68,"text":"鍵盤の道を辿ってエメラルドの街へ行こう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":254.08,"end":257.08000000000004,"text":"「Stupid Clown」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":271.3,"end":274.3,"text":"突然現れたカカシが歌い出す","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":275.43,"end":278.43,"text":"みんながおいらをバカにするのさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":279.07,"end":282.07,"text":"悩みがあるのなら聞いてあげるわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":283.15999999999997,"end":286.15999999999997,"text":"何が？今日は良いお天気ですね","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":287.06,"end":287.71,"text":"え？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":287.71,"end":290.71,"text":"三歩歩けば忘れちまう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":292.15,"end":295.15,"text":"知恵を持たないカカシなのさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":296.12,"end":299.12,"text":"おかげでおいらはお笑い種の","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":300.87,"end":303.87,"text":"いかれた道化さ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":304.81,"end":307.81,"text":"間抜けなピエロのサーカスだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":308.75,"end":311.75,"text":"誰もが指差して笑う","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":313.38,"end":316.38,"text":"それなら一緒に知恵を探しに行こう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":318.33,"end":319.19,"text":"どこへ？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":319.19,"end":321.45,"text":"あの道を 辿って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":321.45,"end":324.45,"text":"さあMusic Wizardの元へ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":330.86,"end":332.90999999999997,"text":"お願いごとはなあに？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":332.90999999999997,"end":335.90999999999997,"text":"もちろん賢い頭脳さ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":336.98,"end":339.98,"text":"さあ足取り軽やかにエメラルドの街へ行こう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":353.07,"end":356.07,"text":"「Metallic Heart」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":365.29,"end":368.29,"text":"突然現れたブリキのロボット","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":370.71,"end":373.71,"text":"油を差したらゆっくりと踊りだして","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":375.9,"end":378.9,"text":"目からレーザービーム","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":378.92,"end":381.92,"text":"プログラムされたダンスなら完璧に踊っているのに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":385.19,"end":388.19,"text":"あなたのダンスにはハートが無いって言われるの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":392.96,"end":395.72,"text":"デジタルの檻の中","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"68","start":395.72,"end":398.72,"text":"与えられた言葉だけじゃ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"69","start":399.03,"end":402.03,"text":"分からない事ばかり","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"70","start":402.15,"end":405.15,"text":"「ウレシイ」「カナシイ」「タノシイ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"71","start":407.6,"end":410.6,"text":"それなら一緒に探しに行こう 君の心","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"72","start":413.40999999999997,"end":416.40999999999997,"text":"なんだって願いを叶えてくれる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"73","start":417.54,"end":420.1,"text":"不思議なMusic Wizard！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"74","start":420.1,"end":423.1,"text":"デジタルの檻の外","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"75","start":423.24,"end":426.24,"text":"鮮やかに彩る世界","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"76","start":426.82,"end":429.47,"text":"この胸で感じたい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"77","start":429.47,"end":432.47,"text":"待ち遠しい私のMetallic Heart","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"78","start":434.11,"end":436.03,"text":"あの道を辿って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"79","start":436.03,"end":439.03,"text":"さあMusic Wizardの元へ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"80","start":446.22,"end":449.22,"text":"お願いごとはなあに？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"81","start":450.03,"end":453.03,"text":"賢い頭脳と 心さ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"82","start":454.11,"end":457.11,"text":"さあ歌声高らかに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"83","start":457.54,"end":460.54,"text":"エメラルドの街へ行こう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"84","start":469.08,"end":471.0,"text":"「Vegetarian Twins」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"85","start":471.0,"end":473.78,"text":"ライオンだ！ （ひぃい...）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"86","start":473.78,"end":476.58,"text":"こっちを見てる...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"87","start":476.58,"end":477.75,"text":"（うがぁう！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"88","start":477.75,"end":480.34,"text":"（キャー！！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"89","start":480.34,"end":483.34,"text":"聞いてくれオレたちの 悲しい物語","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"90","start":489.69,"end":492.69,"text":"ライオンなのに... ライオンなのに...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"91","start":493.84,"end":496.21,"text":"お肉が怖くて食べられない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"92","start":496.21,"end":496.89,"text":"（えーっ！？）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"93","start":496.89,"end":499.89,"text":"今日も狩りへ行くのさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"94","start":501.45,"end":504.45,"text":"キャベツ にんじん ブロッコリー レタスにトマト","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"95","start":504.52,"end":507.32,"text":"立派な牙はあるのに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"96","start":507.32,"end":510.14,"text":"生まれてこのかたベジタリアン","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"97","start":510.14,"end":513.14,"text":"朝ごはん ごぼうサラダ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"98","start":513.48,"end":516.48,"text":"昼ごはん ポテトサラダ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"99","start":516.55,"end":519.38,"text":"晩ごはん ハンバーグ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"100","start":519.38,"end":522.38,"text":"中身はもちろん豆腐","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"101","start":525.04,"end":528.04,"text":"だけど友達には バカにされているんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"102","start":533.94,"end":536.94,"text":"勇気出してお肉も 食べてみたい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"103","start":540.89,"end":543.89,"text":"それなら 勇気を 探しに行こう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"104","start":547.39,"end":550.39,"text":"そしたらきっと食べられる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"105","start":550.45,"end":553.45,"text":"牛肉も 豚肉も 鶏肉も！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"106","start":555.45,"end":558.45,"text":"そして狩りへ行くのさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"107","start":558.51,"end":561.51,"text":"焼肉 しゃぶしゃぶ 親子丼にビーフステーキ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"108","start":561.53,"end":564.47,"text":"新たなメニュー求めて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"109","start":564.47,"end":565.65,"text":"旅に出るのさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"110","start":565.65,"end":567.35,"text":"あの道を辿って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"111","start":567.35,"end":570.35,"text":"さあMusic Wizardの元へ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"112","start":575.3,"end":578.3,"text":"お願いごとはなあに？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"113","start":578.86,"end":581.86,"text":"頭脳と 心と 勇気さ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"114","start":582.8,"end":585.8,"text":"さあみんな手を取り合って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"115","start":586.39,"end":589.39,"text":"エメラルドの街へ行こう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"116","start":599.36,"end":602.36,"text":"「Emerald Girl」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"117","start":607.98,"end":610.07,"text":"Emerald Girl","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"118","start":610.07,"end":613.07,"text":"ようこそエメラルドの眩い光の街へ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"119","start":613.92,"end":616.92,"text":"すべてが輝き放つエメラルドさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"120","start":618.62,"end":621.62,"text":"そしてこの私がエメラルドのMusicで奇跡を巻き起こす","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"121","start":627.67,"end":630.36,"text":"Emerald Girl","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"122","start":630.36,"end":632.64,"text":"エメラルドのPiano","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"123","start":632.64,"end":634.86,"text":"エメラルドのSaxophone","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"124","start":634.86,"end":636.91,"text":"エメラルドのGuitar","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"125","start":636.91,"end":639.26,"text":"エメラルドのDrums","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"126","start":639.26,"end":642.26,"text":"Ah 何ひとつ欠けてちゃ奇跡は起こせないの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"127","start":643.48,"end":646.48,"text":"何ひとつ欠けてちゃWizardになれない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"128","start":646.96,"end":649.96,"text":"盗まれたギターの旋律が叫んでいる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"129","start":652.65,"end":655.65,"text":"不完全な奇跡のMagic","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"130","start":656.13,"end":659.13,"text":"お願いよ誰か取り戻して西の魔女から","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"131","start":661.44,"end":664.4,"text":"魔法のギターを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"132","start":664.4,"end":667.4,"text":"それならば私たちが","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"133","start":668.68,"end":671.68,"text":"知恵を絞って 勇気を出して 力の限り","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"134","start":673.64,"end":676.64,"text":"魔法のギターを取り戻すため","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"135","start":677.99,"end":680.99,"text":"西の魔女の元へ行こう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"136","start":689.83,"end":692.83,"text":"「Lonely Witch」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"137","start":707.48,"end":710.48,"text":"西の砦に鳴り響くMusic","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"138","start":715.21,"end":718.21,"text":"憂いを写した孤独なギター","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"139","start":723.96,"end":726.96,"text":"I'm alone without you","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"140","start":727.15,"end":730.15,"text":"一人きりのコンサートホール","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"141","start":730.96,"end":733.96,"text":"さあPut your hands up","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"142","start":734.82,"end":737.82,"text":"誰も聞いちゃいないのさ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"143","start":738.15,"end":740.93,"text":"Listen to my sounds","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"144","start":740.93,"end":743.93,"text":"美しい音色が泣いている","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"145","start":745.52,"end":748.52,"text":"Listen to my wish","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"146","start":748.84,"end":751.84,"text":"分かち合えないものに意味などあるものか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"147","start":752.9,"end":755.6,"text":"Give me some friendship","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"148","start":755.6,"end":758.6,"text":"Someone please listen to my sounds","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"149","start":771.11,"end":774.11,"text":"それなら 僕たちと一緒に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"150","start":776.42,"end":779.42,"text":"友達を探しに 行こうよMusic Wizardの元へ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"151","start":782.53,"end":785.53,"text":"一人では奇跡は起こせないから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"152","start":787.29,"end":790.29,"text":"みんなで行こうエメラルドの街へ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"153","start":796.18,"end":799.18,"text":"「Our Music」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"154","start":802.17,"end":805.17,"text":"さあ魔法のギターで 僕らの 願いを 叶えて今","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"155","start":825.15,"end":828.15,"text":"ほら耳をすませば聞こえるでしょう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"156","start":828.5,"end":831.5,"text":"誰の中にも隠れてる魔法","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"157","start":834.23,"end":837.23,"text":"誰もが生まれ持った喜びを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"158","start":839.84,"end":842.84,"text":"さあ呼び覚まして答えはそこにあるの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"159","start":848.96,"end":851.96,"text":"想いを唄に出来るのは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"160","start":854.29,"end":857.29,"text":"僕らが知恵を持っているから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"161","start":859.58,"end":862.58,"text":"好きな唄を口ずさむとワクワクするのは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"162","start":867.6,"end":870.6,"text":"僕らが心を持っているから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"163","start":877.39,"end":880.39,"text":"大きな声をあげて唄を歌えるのは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"164","start":884.96,"end":887.96,"text":"僕らが勇気を持っているから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"165","start":888.34,"end":891.34,"text":"そして声を合わせて 喜びを分かち合える","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"166","start":896.39,"end":899.29,"text":"それが友達","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"167","start":899.29,"end":902.29,"text":"ありのままの自分の中に 息づいてる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"168","start":906.03,"end":909.03,"text":"大切なものを 拾い上げて 気付かせてくれる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"169","start":916.1,"end":919.1,"text":"それが奇跡 それがMusic","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"170","start":933.06,"end":936.06,"text":"最後はあなたの願いを聞かせて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"171","start":938.79,"end":941.79,"text":"想いのままに夢を描いて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"172","start":947.27,"end":950.27,"text":"「Dear my Family」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"173","start":952.49,"end":955.49,"text":"ねえ私気付いたの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"174","start":958.74,"end":961.74,"text":"ワクワクする冒険よりも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"175","start":965.1,"end":968.1,"text":"どんな素晴らしい夢よりも","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"176","start":971.41,"end":974.41,"text":"かけがえのないものがあるの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"177","start":977.89,"end":980.89,"text":"憎たらしくなるときもあるけど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"178","start":986.11,"end":989.11,"text":"私の願いはただ一つ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"179","start":990.82,"end":993.82,"text":"家族に会いたい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"180","start":999.3,"end":1002.3,"text":"あなたの愛したあの唄を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"181","start":1005.43,"end":1008.43,"text":"あなたの愛するあの人も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"182","start":1012.15,"end":1015.15,"text":"きっとどこかで口ずさんでいるから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"183","start":1020.6,"end":1023.6,"text":"耳をすまして","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"184","start":1024.82,"end":1027.82,"text":"私の愛するこの唄が私の愛するあの人と","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"185","start":1037.62,"end":1040.62,"text":"私をいつでも繋ぎ合わせている","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"186","start":1046.75,"end":1049.75,"text":"魔法の絆","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"187","start":1059.32,"end":1061.46,"text":"「Finale」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"188","start":1061.46,"end":1064.46,"text":"果てしなく広がるこの空の下","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"189","start":1067.9,"end":1070.9,"text":"僕らを導くのはあのメロディー","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"190","start":1074.89,"end":1077.89,"text":"遥かなる時間を越えて繋がる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"191","start":1082.06,"end":1085.06,"text":"どんなときも心は覚えているよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"192","start":1088.89,"end":1091.89,"text":"奇跡のMusic","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}